'''Cosmog''' (Japanese: '''コスモッグ''' ''Cosmog'') is a {{ct|Psychic}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

