==Trivia==
This card is almost identical to {{TCG ID|Ultra Prism|Cosmog|60}} from the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]'s {{TCG|Ultra Prism}} expansion, except for the {{TCG|Weakness}} modifier.

===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Team Up|Cosmog|69}} from the {{TCG|Team Up}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Cosmic Eclipse|Cosmog|99}} from the {{TCG|Cosmic Eclipse}} expansion.
*{{m|Teleport}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Cosmog}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

